    "A published population statistic, not data from other Tallyist users — nothing about your log leaves this device. Percentages come from the survey's distribution of weekly drinks among US adults, recalculated to cover only the 72% who reported drinking, and compared by grams of alcohol. Your average covers your last 4 weeks." : {
